\">$0&lt;H&lt;1$</span> on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$B_{r_2}(0)\\setminus \\overline B_{r_1}(0)$\">$B_{r_2}(0)\\setminus \\overline B_{r_1}(0)$</span>, and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$H=0$\">$H=0$</span> outside <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$B_{r_2}(0)$\">$B_{r_2}(0)$</span>.  <p></p><section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch Set <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$H(x)=h(|x|)$\">$H(x)=h(|x|)$</span> for the cutoff <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$h$\">$h$</span> of Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeSmooth%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3A2-21\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeSmooth/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:2-21\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a322d3231\">2</a>. It is smooth away from <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$0$\">$0$</span> and constant near <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$0$\">$0$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeSmooth/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:2-10-extra-1","next":"references/LeeSmooth/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:2-10-extra-2","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeSmooth/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:2-21","title":"lem:2-21","label":"lem:2-21"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeSmooth/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:2-10-extra-2","title":"def:2-10-extra-2","label":"def:2-10-extra-2"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeSmooth/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:2-23","title":"thm:2-23","label":"thm:2-23"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeSmooth/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:2-22","title":"lem:2-22","tex":"\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lem:2-22}\n\n\\us